{"org":"elastic","repo":"elasticsearch","prNumber":"110251","commit":"1b592d0b38df1bc26403879c880ef04b8d55ff54","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The test case `testIndexSortWithNestedFields` should be split into multiple tests to cover different scenarios clearly. The current test checks both the validation and parsing of documents, which can make it harder to pinpoint issues if one part fails. Additionally, the nested field check now iterates over each index sort field and checks if it starts with any nested object path. This is more precise but could be optimized for performance if there are many fields or nested objects. Consider using a data structure that allows faster lookups, such as a prefix tree (trie), to improve efficiency.","nodes":[{"id":"server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/MapperServiceTests.java-server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/MapperServiceTests.java-6391:6746,6756:6878,7064:7298,7307:7429-6391:6639,6649:6834,6843:6872,6881:6932,7118:7275,7285:7368,7377:7938,7947:8069","promptId":"#VJM77","srcPath":"server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/MapperServiceTests.java","dstPath":"server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/MapperServiceTests.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":6391,"endPos":6746,"startLine":129,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":135,"endLineOffset":10,"length":356},{"pos":6756,"endPos":6878,"startLine":137,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":137,"endLineOffset":130,"length":123},{"pos":7064,"endPos":7298,"startLine":143,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":147,"endLineOffset":13,"length":235},{"pos":7307,"endPos":7429,"startLine":148,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":148,"endLineOffset":130,"length":123}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":6391,"endPos":6639,"startLine":129,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":132,"endLineOffset":29,"length":249},{"pos":6649,"endPos":6834,"startLine":134,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":137,"endLineOffset":19,"length":186},{"pos":6843,"endPos":6872,"startLine":138,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":138,"en